{"id":"arnhem","name":"阿纳姆","en":"Arnhem","country":"Netherlands","lat":51.9833,"lng":5.9167,"dek":"桥影、绿意与重建的城","history":"阿纳姆的历史可追溯至九世纪，1233年正式建城。此后数百年，它作为海尔德兰省的首府逐渐发展，地处荷兰东部，成为区域交通与贸易的节点。十九世纪铁路通达，城市面貌随之改变，中央车站启用于1845年，如今已是第四代站房。\n\n1940年5月，纳粹德国占领阿纳姆。1944年9月，市场花园行动在此展开，英军与波兰空降部队试图夺取莱茵河上的阿纳姆大桥，却始终未能成功，战役以德军决定性胜利告终，空降部队损失惨重。这段战事后来被拍成电影《夺桥遗恨》，桥与空降成为城市记忆中难以绕开的部分。\n\n战后阿纳姆迅速重建，逐渐发展为纤维、钢铁业盛行的产业城市，同时注重绿化，有花园城市之誉。城北郊是荷兰梵高国家森林公园。1980年，夏季残疾人奥林匹克运动会在此举办，城市由此在现代体育史上留下一笔。","culture":"阿纳姆的文化气质里，战争记忆与艺术气息并存。空降兵博物馆保存着市场花园行动的史料，约翰·福洛斯特大桥横跨莱茵河，名字来自当年战役中的指挥官，桥与博物馆共同构成一段可触摸的历史。\n\n另一方面，这座城市绿荫环抱，艺术与时尚气息浓厚。荷兰露天博物馆把老建筑与民俗搬进园区，皇家比赫尔斯动物园是当地人常去的去处，阿尔特兹艺术学院则为城市添了年轻的气息。诺贝尔物理学奖获得者亨德里克·洛伦兹也出生于此。","pull":"一座桥，记住了战争，也记住了重建。","sights":[{"name":"约翰·福洛斯特大桥","orig":"John Frostbrug","intro":"横跨莱茵河的大桥，前身即市场花园行动中未能夺下的阿纳姆大桥。桥以英军指挥官约翰·福洛斯特命名，站在桥上可见宽阔河面与两岸低地，是理解1944年那场战役最直接的地点。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f0/Arnhem%2C_de_John_Frostbrug_RM529907_vanaf_Arnhem_Zuid_IMG_8947_2019-03-31_20.13.jpg/960px-Arnhem%2C_de_John_Frostbrug_RM529907_vanaf_Arnhem_Zuid_IMG_8947_2019-03-31_20.13.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":414},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Frost_Bridge"},{"name":"空降兵博物馆","orig":"Airborne Museum Hartenstein","intro":"设于战役期间英军指挥部的旧宅内，展出手稿、武器与影像，讲述1944年9月空降部队在阿纳姆周边的行动。展陈不大，却把市场花园行动的失败与代价讲得具体，适合与大桥一同参观。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fc/Airborne_Museum_Hartenstein.jpg/960px-Airborne_Museum_Hartenstein.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":644},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Airborne_Museum_'Hartenstein'"},{"name":"荷兰露天博物馆","orig":"Nederlands Openluchtmuseum","intro":"把荷兰各地的老房屋、作坊与农场迁建于此，形成一座可步行穿过的园区。风车、农舍与手工艺演示让抽象的历史变得可看可触，适合慢慢走，感受不同地区的日常旧貌。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/87/Nederlands_Openluchtmuseum827.JPG/960px-Nederlands_Openluchtmuseum827.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%8D%B7%E8%98%AD%E9%9C%B2%E5%A4%A9%E5%8D%9A%E7%89%A9%E9%A4%A8"},{"name":"皇家比赫尔斯动物园","orig":"Koninklijke Burgers' Zoo","intro":"城北的动物园，以生态化展区著称，设有丛林、沙漠、海洋等主题馆。园区试图还原动物栖息环境，而不是简单排列笼舍，是当地人常带孩子前来的休闲去处。","img":{"u":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a7/Ovis_canadensis_-_Bighorn_Sheep2_BZ_ies.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","w":960,"h":840},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Royal_Burgers'_Zoo"},{"name":"荷兰梵高国家森林公园","orig":"De Hoge Veluwe National Park","intro":"位于阿纳姆北郊的自然保护区，沙地、林地与荒原交错，园内还藏有库勒-穆勒博物馆，收藏大量梵高作品。租一辆园内白色自行车穿行其间，是看画与看风景结合的方式。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/24/Veluwezoom_6.jpg/960px-Veluwezoom_6.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":640},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%8A%E8%B2%BB%E5%91%82%E6%B2%83%E5%9C%8B%E5%AE%B6%E5%85%AC%E5%9C%92"}],"foods":[{"name":"阿纳姆特色饼干","orig":"Arnhemse meisjes","intro":"阿纳姆的传统点心，薄片饼干覆糖，口感脆而带甜。名字意为“阿纳姆女孩”，在当地面包房与点心店可以买到，适合配茶或咖啡。","img":{"u":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1a/Blikje_arnhemse_meisjes.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","w":960,"h":663},"src":null},{"name":"海尔德兰熏肠","orig":"Gelderse rookworst","intro":"海尔德兰地区常见的熏制香肠，肉质紧实，熏香明显。通常与土豆泥或酸菜同食，也可夹在面包里，是荷兰东部冬天餐桌上的常客。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/50/Boerenkool_met_worst.jpg/960px-Boerenkool_met_worst.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rookworst"},{"name":"荷兰松饼","orig":"Stroopwafel","intro":"两片薄烤饼夹入焦糖糖浆，趁热吃时糖浆微融。阿纳姆的集市与糕点摊上常见，也可盖在热饮杯口稍作加热再吃。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9a/Stroopwafels_01.jpg/960px-Stroopwafels_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":960},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stroopwafel"},{"name":"小煎饼","orig":"Poffertjes","intro":"荷兰常见的小圆煎饼，蓬松微甜，通常撒糖粉并配黄油。阿纳姆的集市摊位或煎饼店可吃到现做的，适合当作散步途中的小食。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6f/Poffertjes-Melkhuis_%28cropped%29.jpg/960px-Poffertjes-Melkhuis_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":611},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Poffertjes"}],"hero":[{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/47/Arnhem_Blick_von_der_Grote_Kerk_Sint_Eusebius_09.jpg/1280px-Arnhem_Blick_von_der_Grote_Kerk_Sint_Eusebius_09.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":896},{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5d/Arnhem_centraal_station.JPG/1280px-Arnhem_centraal_station.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":853}],"outline":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[5.8029606,52.0040541],[5.8262759,51.9995557],[5.8471221,51.9983567],[5.856213,51.9961013],[5.8637396,51.99589],[5.8625601,51.991221],[5.8647025,51.9910815],[5.8631539,51.9852905],[5.8662371,51.9841123],[5.8673698,51.98029],[5.8637369,51.9779647],[5.8658999,51.9756857],[5.8691869,51.9759914],[5.8708603,51.975113],[5.865321,51.9709153],[5.8591209,51.9695363],[5.8353427,51.9735587],[5.8361983,51.9708873],[5.8353818,51.9708488],[5.8359788,51.9663305],[5.8351813,51.9641686],[5.8340066,51.9627147],[5.8293395,51.9608481],[5.8301975,51.9586238],[5.8313446,51.9585357],[5.8312824,51.9555475],[5.8287707,51.9500401],[5.8299277,51.9452369],[5.8373043,51.9451775],[5.8373074,51.9441593],[5.8496798,51.9429442],[5.8503943,51.9445103],[5.8685004,51.9421845],[5.8879731,51.9360957],[5.9018637,51.9334642],[5.9127671,51.9452929],[5.910965,51.9459069],[5.9113666,51.947273],[5.9150607,51.949901],[5.9264856,51.9511453],[5.9294463,51.9